info.description:
WebSocket-only Postman collection for the DOQ Server chat endpoint.

Important: Postman saves WebSocket requests in a separate beta collection type and does not mix them with HTTP requests.

Connect to: ws://localhost:9571/v1/session/chat?sid={{sid}}
Example message body:
{
  "hd": { "event": "chat.message", "role": "A" },
  "bd": { "text": "안녕하세요!" }
}
